Transformation Plan.

1) In Prdc::FieldState, replace use of UnitCell by use of FSArray<6, double>
   Adapt algorithms that get and set these parameters.

2) Define virtual functions for mulVS and addEqVc operations for linear 
   algebra operations on State classes. Use wrappers around existing 
   VecOp functions for DArray.

3) Reimplement state extrapolation using vecOp functions for states.

4) Add Sweep as a parameter and base class for SweepTmpl, and reverse
   order of inheritances (Sweep becones a base of SweepTmpl, rather
   than the reverse). 

   As part of this, go through functions currently defined in Sweep
   class that depend on knowledge of the State, and move them down
   into the SweepTmpl. Specifically:
         Move extrapolate to the SweepTmpl
         Move reset to SweepTmpl
         Break up getSolution

5) Create Rp::BasisSweep and implement getSystemState and setSystemState
   functions in that class.

6) Create separate LagrangeExtrapolator and ParameterTypeList classes.
   Make them components of SweepTmpl.
